import Foundation

enum PrivacyContent {
    static let version = "2026-11-02"
    static let policyURL = URL(string: "https://manna-circle.micahlai.com/privacy")!
    static let contact = "micahlaidev@gmail.com"
    static let sections: [(String, String)] = [
        ("Who we are", "manna circle is operated by Micah Lai. Contact micahlaidev@gmail.com with privacy, safety, access, or deletion questions. This policy describes the current app and its services. Effective November 2, 2026."),
        ("Age and availability", "The initial launch is for people age 13 and older in the United States. Do not create an account if you are under 13. If you believe a child under 13 has supplied information, contact us so we can investigate and remove it. An App Store age rating does not replace this rule."),
        ("Information you share", "We receive your Apple sign-in identifier, name and email or Apple relay email where supplied; profile name/photo; circle memberships, settings and invitations; blessings, transcripts, Bible references, photos, audio, videos and responses; and dates of these actions. Faith-related posts may reveal religious beliefs or other sensitive information. Share only what you want your circle to see, and do not post someone else’s private information without permission."),
        ("How information is used", "We use this information to authenticate you, operate private circles, deliver posts and notifications, prevent abuse, investigate reports, and respond to support and privacy requests. Authorized circle members can see content according to the sharing rules; current peer posts unlock after your submission. Members can save copies on their devices or export media. We cannot recall copies another person has already saved or shared."),
        ("Service providers", "Supabase processes accounts, database records, diagnostics and private media. Cloudflare processes background copies of uploaded media, avatars and circle photos. Apple processes Sign in with Apple, notification delivery and device permissions. Apple’s speech service may process audio when you choose transcription; processing is not guaranteed to stay on this device. Operational service logs can include IP addresses and request metadata. Providers process data to deliver and secure these services. We do not sell your personal information, use your posts for advertising, or train our own AI models on them."),
        ("Optional diagnostics", "Diagnostic sharing starts off and requires your choice. If enabled, account-linked batches include timings, transfer sizes, failure categories and short codes, app build and a random session code. They exclude post text, recordings, photos, names, URLs, credentials and error messages. Reports are retained for 14 days with scheduled cleanup. Turn sharing off in User settings to stop future collection and discard unsent records; a request already underway may finish. Essential service security logs are separate from this optional feature."),
        ("Device permissions", "Camera, microphone and speech access are requested when you choose capture or transcription. The system photo picker exposes only the files you select; saving to Photos requests add permission. You can keep using typed posts when capture permissions are denied. Notifications are optional and use generic alerts rather than blessing/reply contents or media. Widgets and Live Activities may show circle or blessing information on your device; you control whether to add or enable them."),
        ("Retention and deletion", "Account and circle content is retained to provide your history until deletion or another disclosed cleanup applies. Automatic age-based media cleanup is not currently enabled in the hosted test service; do not rely on older in-app references to a guaranteed 30-day deletion. The launch retention schedule is under review. Deleting your account requests removal of your profile, authored content, memberships, tokens and owned media from Supabase and Cloudflare. Processing may take time during retries; completion must be verified across both stores. Local copies on other members’ devices, exported copies, and provider backups may remain outside the active service. Contact us for the current status of a request. We retain only information required for legitimate security/legal obligations, with access restricted."),
        ("Your choices and rights", "Read this policy in User settings at any time. You can change optional diagnostics and device permissions, leave circles, block users, report content, and request account deletion in the app. You may contact us to request access, correction or deletion of personal information and to ask about applicable privacy rights. We may verify your identity before disclosing or deleting information. We do not use advertising tracking and do not request App Tracking Transparency permission."),
        ("Security and updates", "We use authenticated access, private storage, encrypted connections and restricted server credentials. The service can process content; it is not end-to-end encrypted. No system can guarantee absolute security. We will update this policy when practices change and request a new choice where needed before materially different collection or sharing.")
    ]
    static let communityRules = "Do not post sexual exploitation, nudity, threats, harassment, hate, doxxing, graphic violence, scams, or content you do not have permission to share. Do not target people for their religion or beliefs. Report harmful posts and block abusive users. New audio, video and attached photos are held from peers until the developer reviews them. Text is checked for a limited set of prohibited phrases; report contextual abuse the filter misses. Reports go to the developer for review; urgent real-world danger requires local emergency help. manna is not an emergency or counseling service."
}
